  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>By comparison, we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Since&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;so,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is increasing in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is an increasing function in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>"
